Package: oocpio
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: CPIO ARCHIVE MANAGER
 Initramfs cpio format unpacker and archiver for Linux kernel boot images.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 SVR4 portable newc format, initramfs packing, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
